THIRD-PARTY ART, EXCLUDED

The tile art the game draws with is not covered by the notice above and is not
in this repository. It is the "Playdate Dungeon Tileset (Top-Down 20x20)" by
schwarnhild, used under that pack's own licence, which permits its use in
commercial projects and forbids its redistribution. See NOTICE. It is fetched at
deploy time from a private store and served by the game, as any game serves its
art; it is not offered for download here, and nothing here is derived from it.
